LICENSE (placeholder)
=====================

Halcyon — a calm, from-scratch 3D modeling and animation suite.
Part of the Faded Dream Project. https://github.com/Faded-Dream-Project

The final license has not been chosen yet. The project's stated intent:

  - Halcyon's own code will be released under a permissive license
    (MIT, BSD, zlib or public domain class).
  - No copyleft license will be accepted anywhere in Halcyon's
    dependency graph. Every third-party component requires a
    permissive license, a written justification in
    docs/dependencies.md, and an entry in THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md.

Until the decision is recorded here, all rights are reserved by the
Faded Dream Project; do not redistribute.

FDK note: Halcyon links against the separately-installed Faded Dream
ToolKit (FDK), which is proprietary software under its own license
(https://github.com/Faded-Dream-Project/FDK). FDK's license governs FDK
itself, not applications built with it; Halcyon neither bundles nor
redistributes the FDK runtime or source.
